Package: com.samcejko.tikie
Name: TikTak
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unofficial TikTok viewer for iOS 6 (universal), in English and Czech: a For You feed that learns what you like, search, hashtags and sounds, captions, photo posts, TikTok LIVE, comments with replies, creator profiles and saved videos. Needs its helper on your own server.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Multimedia
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
